<section aria-labelledby="story-title" class="scroll-mt-20 bg-oat-soft py-20 sm:py-28" id="story"><div class="container-soft grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-6"><div class="reveal lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-1"><p class="eyebrow">Our story</p><h2 class="headline mt-4 max-w-[15ch]" id="story-title">Home should be the best part of the day.</h2><div class="mt-6 max-w-[46ch] space-y-4 text-[1.02rem] leading-[1.75] text-charcoal/70"><p>Most of life happens at home: the slow mornings, the late films, the evenings you finally get to yourself.</p><p>Nolla exists to make those hours something to look forward to, with things that are soft, generous and made to be lived in. We started with one blanket, and we made it the best we could.</p></div><p class="mt-8 font-serif text-[1.6rem] font-light italic tracking-[-0.02em] text-mocha">Make staying in feel better.</p><p class="mt-2 font-serif text-[1.1rem] lowercase tracking-[-0.03em] text-charcoal/60">— nolla</p></div><div class="reveal lg:col-span-5 lg:col-start-8"><div class="relative mx-auto aspect-[3/4] max-w-md overflow-hidden rounded-soft bg-oat lg:max-w-none"><img alt="Someone snuggled up inside the white Nuv blanket in an armchair." class="object-cover" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 38vw, 90vw" src="{{ 'nuv-tosca-white-snuggled.webp' | asset_url }}" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/></div></div></div></section>

